# RunicAI Tool Agent

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:runic_ai, path: ".."}
])
```

This notebook sketches the tool-agent contracts with deterministic data. Use
the recipe guide for the full workflow.

```elixir
alias RunicAI.Tool.Definition

weather_tool =
  Definition.new!(
    name: "get_weather",
    description: "Get the weather for a city.",
    parameter_schema: [location: [type: :string, required: true]],
    executor: fn %{location: location} ->
      {:ok, %{location: location, forecast: "sunny"}}
    end
  )

weather_tool.name
```

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  model[LLM result] --> requests[Tool call requests]
  requests --> plan[Execution plan]
  plan --> tools[Tool executors]
  tools --> observations[Tool observations]
  observations --> prompt[Next prompt]
```
